            "_key": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b8-semeval-8728",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-8728",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:46309af74ee981ab0154432b1e178b31ae5d4ffec4a81c930772677b9742bc09",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:24:40.984962+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b8",
            "text": "Patty the Milkmaid was going to market carrying her milk in a pail on her head.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T13:24:40.984962+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-terra-low-r1-b8-semeval-8838",
            "_key": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b8-semeval-8838",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-8838",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:8c5442633fd4b7e2983829861237f3f2624c973195df7e94b45c8224b55f49bc",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:24:40.984969+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b8",
            "text": "The girls drank the vodka out of plastic water bottles.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T13:24:40.984969+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-terra-low-r1-b8-semeval-8863",
            "_key": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b8-semeval-8863",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-8863",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:ff9c6b2b322c0e39addeb67cf6fd7f384d6eeec8101adfa68ee2b51a5ee01802",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:24:40.984977+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b8",
            "text": "As a result, the brain is depleted of dopamine, which causes the severe depression after the cocaine has dissipated.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T13:24:40.984977+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-terra-low-r1-b8-semeval-9085",
            "_key": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b8-semeval-9085",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-9085",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:1ae89e385a464d65c1a495d906bf6014199aa98abe07d260ca6352b9e4140198",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:24:40.984989+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b8",
            "text": "It's a long, polyphonic novel bookended by a virtuoso first-person discourse from Madero, a cocky, seventeen-year-old student poet.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T13:24:40.984989+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-terra-low-r1-b8-semeval-9097",
            "_key": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b8-semeval-9097",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-9097",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:439659014604b8eab50e7b3157ba10ee9a0671d5ae9aae9c2b42c2585915739d",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:24:40.985010+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b8",
            "text": "We were forced to get off the bus and find accommodation for the night, while the police officers took the bus to the scene of the incident; apparently they were lacking their own transportation.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T13:24:40.985010+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-terra-low-r1-b8-semeval-9629",
            "_key": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b8-semeval-9629",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-9629",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:92873e1cafbcc87f0b0fcfc797edf35a34d22185bddd157fec875bd2e7c69ded",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:24:40.985020+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b8",
            "text": "He published important works on epistemology, as well as works relevant to religion, law, and history.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T13:24:40.985020+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-terra-low-r1-b8-semeval-9899",
            "_key": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b8-semeval-9899",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-9899",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:2a46111354d82c4f47d9fad752f3e6ff79ba3e64eda13d2de7f11e3f53183c7f",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:24:40.985035+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b8",
            "text": "The paper reported a 'palpable sense of disappointment' from the audience.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T13:24:40.985035+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-terra-low-r1-b8-semeval-9902",
            "_key": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b8-semeval-9902",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-9902",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:ea6e3f2727c3f4c8730aeec747b64c0a7942f8d3d4c971eb149e1a91a531379b",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:24:40.985043+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b8",
            "text": "These old power plants produce pollution that causes smog, acid rain and global warming, and they generate radioactive wastes and other toxic pollutants.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T13:24:40.985043+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-terra-low-r1-b8-semeval-9973",
            "_key": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b8-semeval-9973",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-9973",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:d7c02e0e29553022a34fe1e9c5ead0b6ece9911b86bdeef9e8e6a1bd89e40ea4",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:24:40.985045+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b8",
            "text": "The main theme of the play is ambition and how it can destroy a courageous, trustworthy, noble man.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T13:24:40.985045+00:00"
          }
        ]
